msgctxt "80"
msgid ""
"Take care of this place while Kazuki's out of commission,\r\n"
"Yuya."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "92"
msgid ""
"I'll do what I can. Well, Kiryu-san... I guess this is it.\r\n"
"Good luck down there. Oh, and you too, Haruka-chan!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid "So? What's with the getup?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"Oh, just gettin' my clean on. Those Go-Ryu punks tore the\r\n"
"place up real bad."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid "Everyone's really been pitchin' in, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid "So they're doing all the work while you smoke?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid ""
"What!? You got it all wrong, Haruka-chan! I was just takin'\r\n"
"a little breather!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid "Heh. By the way, how are you feeling?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid ""
"What, me? Better than ever, man! It'll take more than a few\r\n"
"punches to put a dent in ol' Yuya."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid "Urgh... It hurts to laugh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid ""
"If that's \"better than ever,\" I don't wanna see what you\r\n"
"hurt looks like. Oh, and how's Kazuki doing?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid ""
"Still over with the doc. Sounds like it's still gonna be\r\n"
"a while 'til he can come home... But he's doin' good!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid ""
"Glad to hear it. By the way, Yuya... We're actually here to\r\n"
"say goodbye."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid "Huh!? Whaddya mean, \"goodbye\"!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid ""
"I'm moving to Okinawa. Gonna be taking over an orphanage\r\n"
"down there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid "And you're goin' too, Haruka-chan?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid "Mhm!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid ""
"The place actually has pretty close ties to Sunflower, too.\r\n"
"After what Haruka and I have been through, I think it'll\r\n"
"feel good looking after some kids myself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid ""
"Well, that's outright charitable of ya, man. But I gotta say,\r\n"
"it's gonna be lonely 'round here without you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid ""
"It's not like we're gonna be that far. We can still see\r\n"
"each other, you know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid "You could even come visit us sometime."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid ""
"Y'know, that ain't such a bad idea! I'll ask Kazuki-san\r\n"
"about takin' the team down there for our next vacation!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid ""
"Heh, sounds like a plan. Speaking of, I'm actually thinking\r\n"
"to go see Kazuki now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid "Oh yeah? Sure he'll be happy to see you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid ""
"Hope so. Anyway, Yuya... Take care of this place while\r\n"
"Kazuki's out of commission, okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "380"
msgid ""
"I'll do what I can. Well, Kiryu-san... I guess this is it.\r\n"
"Good luck down there. Oh, and you too, Haruka-chan!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid "Bye, Uncle Yuya! Don't forget to come visit!"
msgstr ""

